<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 28/29.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 28/29.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for April</p>
<p>28/29. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	  April 28/29    April 25-28</p>
<p> CZK	0.44633	 0.44916</p>
<p> DKK	2.10129	 2.10035</p>
<p> FIM	2.6629	  2.65949</p>
<p> HUF	0.07604	 0.07589</p>
<p> JPY	0.10942	 0.10894</p>
<p> LTL	3.4645	  3.43189</p>
<p> LVL     23.72336	23.60052</p>
<p> RUR	0.00241	 0.00239</p>
<p> SEK	1.7766	  1.78386</p>
<p> UAH	7.52539	 7.46073</p>
<p> USD     13.585	  13.7296</p>
<p> XEU     15.61034	15.57623</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
